                        </div>

                        <div class="project-overview">
                            <span>
                            As the final project for ENGR162 my team was tasked to create a LEGO robot to autonomously navigate a walled maze,
                            while avoiding hazards (magnetic and IR beacons). My team created a robot using three ultrasonic sensors (at the
                            front, and left/right sides), alongside an IMU and IR sensor for hazard detection. I also worked on developing and
                            fine-tuning a PID algorithm to optimize the robot’s turning and staying on course. I also worked on creating a custom
                            cargo container with CAD.
                            </span>
